   1. ANC ≤ 1.5 x 109/L;
   2. PLT ≤ 80 x 109/L;
   3. Hb ≤ 90 g/L (no blood transfusion within the last 14 days);
   4. AST and ALT ≥ 2.5 x ULN;
   5. TBIL ≥ 1.5 x ULN;
   6. Creatinine ≥ 1.5 x ULN.
